@startuml 15-sequence-audit-pipeline
' ========================================
' Figure 2.15 — Audit Pipeline (Hybrid Orchestration + Choreography)
' Source: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-09-microservices-architecture-design.md
' Generated: 2026-04-10
' Type: sequence
' ========================================

!include _style.iuml
scale max 1920 width

title Figure 2.15 — Audit Pipeline\n(Hybrid Orchestration + Choreography)
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"

actor "User" as U
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as FE
box "Gateway Service" #E8F5E9
  participant "REST API\n(port 3000)" as API
  participant "Socket.IO\nGateway" as WS
end box
queue "BullMQ\n(Redis)" as MQ #F3E5F5
database "Gateway DB\n(PG #1)" as GDB #FFF4D6

box "Workers" #F5F5F5
  participant "Crawler\nWorker" as CR
  participant "SEO Analyzer\nWorker" as AN
  participant "Keyword\nAnalyzer Worker" as KW
  participant "Report\nWorker" as RP
end box

database "Redis\n(Cache + Pub/Sub)" as RD #FFE0E0

== Phase 1: Submit (Orchestration — Gateway controls) ==

U -> FE : Submit URL
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/audits\n{url, targetKeyword?}
activate API
API -> API : Validate JWT\n+ Rate limit check\n+ SSRF URL check
API -> GDB : INSERT audit\n(status: pending, 0%)
GDB --> API : audit_id
API -> MQ : enqueue **crawl.start**\n{auditId, url, options}
API --> FE : **202** {auditId, status: "pending"}
deactivate API
FE -> WS : Socket.IO: join room(auditId)

== Phase 2: Crawling (Orchestration) ==

MQ -> CR : pick job **crawl.start**
activate CR #E3F2FD
CR ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (10%)
WS -->> FE : progress event
FE --> U : "Crawling..." (10%)

CR -> CR : Cheerio fetch HTML\n(SPA? → Playwright fallback)
CR ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (25%)
WS -->> FE : progress event

CR -> CR : Run Lighthouse\n(CWV metrics)
CR ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (40%)
WS -->> FE : progress event

CR -> RD : Cache crawl result (30min)
CR -> MQ : emit **crawl.done**\n{auditId, pageData, cwvMetrics, textContent}
deactivate CR

== Phase 3: Analysis (Choreography — Event-driven, PARALLEL) ==

note over MQ : BullMQ listener picks\ncrawl.done → enqueues\n2 parallel jobs

MQ -> AN : enqueue **analyze.start**\n{auditId, pageData, cwvMetrics}
MQ -> KW : enqueue **keyword.start**\n{auditId, textContent, targetKeyword}

activate AN #E8F5E9
activate KW #FFF8E1

AN ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (55%)
WS -->> FE : progress event
FE --> U : "Analyzing..." (55%)

AN -> AN : Apply 20 SEO rules\nCalc category scores\nCalc weighted overall
KW -> KW : Tokenize\nRemove stopwords\nCalc TF & density

AN -> RD : Store analyze result\naudit:{id}:analyze_result
AN -> RD : INCR audit:{id}:completed_steps → **1**
AN -> MQ : emit **analyze.done**\n{auditId, ruleResults[], categoryScores[]}
deactivate AN
AN ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (70%)

KW -> RD : Store keyword result\naudit:{id}:keyword_result
KW -> RD : INCR audit:{id}:completed_steps → **2**
KW -> MQ : emit **keyword.done**\n{auditId, keywords[]}
deactivate KW
KW ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (75%)

note over RD : completed_steps = 2\n→ Both done!\n→ Trigger report.start

== Phase 4: Reporting (Choreography) ==

MQ -> RP : enqueue **report.start**\n{auditId}
activate RP #FFF3E0
RP -> RD : GET audit:{id}:analyze_result\nGET audit:{id}:keyword_result
RP ->> WS : emit **audit.progress** (85%)
WS -->> FE : progress event
FE --> U : "Generating report..." (85%)

RP -> RP : Aggregate scores\nCalc final score\nClassify (excellent/good/fair/poor)
RP -> RP : Persist to Report DB\n(reports, report_keywords, report_cwv)

RP -> MQ : emit **report.done**\n{auditId, finalScore, reportId}
deactivate RP

== Phase 5: Completion ==

MQ -> API : event: **report.done**
activate API
API -> GDB : UPDATE audit\nstatus=completed\nseo_score=finalScore
API -> WS : emit **audit.completed**\n{auditId, score, 100%}
deactivate API
WS -->> FE : completed event
FE --> U : Show results (100%)

U -> FE : View full report
FE -> API : GET /api/v1/audits/{id}
API -> RP : gRPC: GetReport(auditId)
RP --> API : GetReportResponse
API --> FE : 200 {full report data}
FE --> U : Render SEO report

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  | <#E8F5E9> | Gateway / Normal flow |
  | <#E3F2FD> | Crawler Service |
  | <#FFF8E1> | Keyword Analyzer |
  | <#FFF3E0> | Report Service |
  | <#F3E5F5> | BullMQ (Redis) |
endlegend

caption Source: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-09-microservices-architecture-design.md §3

@enduml
